Short:        Neovim 0.12 for UP-Term
Author:       spotUP
Uploader:     UPLOADER-ADDRESS-PLACEHOLDER (spotUP)
Type:         text/edit
Version:      @VERSION@
Replaces:     none
Architecture: m68k-amigaos >= 3.0.0; m68k-020
Requires:     comm/term/up-term.lha >= @NEEDSBASE@ (it brings the patched ixemul.library)
Distribution: Aminet

Neovim 0.12 with its runtime for an UP-Term window (TERM=vtcon, the patched ixemul.library of
the base archive).

Needs the base archive up-term.lha (version @NEEDSBASE@ or newer) installed first. About
32 MB installed.

Install: unpack, double-click Install. Uninstall removes UP-Term:nvim.

Licence: Apache 2.0 with Vim-licensed parts (Neovim); bundled libraries carry their own
(see LICENSES.txt in the base archive).
